# Customer data — never commit
*QC*Budget*.xlsx
*Qualcomm*.xlsx
src/fixtures/real/
.env.local*
functions/.env

# Debug/seed HTML pages under public/ ship as live static assets on deploy —
# never commit one (the app's real entry point is the root index.html, not
# anything under public/).
public/*.html

# FUSE filesystem artifacts — deleted-but-still-open files the kernel keeps
# alive as .fuse_hiddenXXXX until the last handle closes. They appear scattered
# under src/ and the repo root, are never source, and would be swept in by a
# `git add .`. Ignored so they can't be staged by accident.
.fuse_hidden*
